## About changelog
zk.about.changelog.newfeatures=§bNEW FEATURES
zk.about.changelog.changes=§aCHANGES
zk.about.changelog.fixes=§eFIXES
zk.about.changelog051.title=§aHUD FIX
zk.about.changelog51.label1=- Fixed the item total in the HUD showing 0, now it shows the total amount and the slots, such as 256x (4 slots).
zk.about.changelog51.label2=- Added spacing around the item total text.
zk.about.changelog050.title=§aHUD AND CHAT
zk.about.changelog50.label1=- HUD ported with exact experience level and points, hotbar cycle buttons, held item panel, and a compass and clock.
zk.about.changelog50.label2=- Player list menu with a toggle for the scoreboard sidebar.
zk.about.changelog50.label3=- Chat with message search bar and caret mode.
zk.about.changelog50.label4=- Item search tab in every screen with an inventory that highlights matching items, with an invert option and a found counter in chests.
zk.about.changelog50.label5=- Fuel guide tab in the furnaces, with the burning time and the items smelted by each fuel, and the recipe search tab moved beside it.
zk.about.changelog50.label6=- Item count of bundles shown in the HUD.
zk.about.changelog50.label7=- Scoreboard and chat settings screens adapted to the pack style.
zk.about.changelog50.label8=- Pause screen how to play button now uses a book icon.
zk.about.changelog040.title=§aWORKSTATIONS
zk.about.changelog40.label1=- Item modes and amount selector in furnaces, anvil, grindstone, stonecutter, loom, beacon, enchanting table, smithing table, cartography table, brewing stand, trading, and horses.
zk.about.changelog40.label2=- Brewing stand with a guide of every potion recipe, brewing time, and fuel left.
zk.about.changelog40.label3=- Trading with item search, enchanted offers filter, instant trade, trade all, and level progress.
zk.about.changelog40.label4=- Armor preview in the smithing table, with rotation sliders.
zk.about.changelog40.label5=- Durability gained in the anvil and grindstone, and craft count in the stonecutter.
zk.about.changelog40.label6=- Player level and XP lost per option in the enchanting table.
zk.about.changelog40.label7=- Progress percentages in the furnaces.
zk.about.changelog40.label8=- Amount selector moved beside the Inventory label in every screen.
zk.about.changelog40.label9=- Anvil name field accepts up to 50 characters.
zk.about.changelog031.title=§aMOVE ALL BUTTONS
zk.about.changelog31.label1=- Move all buttons in chests, barrels, shulker boxes, copper chests, hoppers, droppers, and dispensers.
zk.about.changelog31.label2=- Amount selector moved to the title row, before the close button.
zk.about.changelog31.label3=- Loading resource packs screen redesigned in the dark Ore UI style, with the full title visible.
zk.about.changelog31.label4=- Fixed the amount selector overlapping the first inventory row in storage screens.
zk.about.changelog030.title=§aINVENTORY AND CHESTS
zk.about.changelog30.label1=- Inventory with item modes, amount selector, and item lore viewer.
zk.about.changelog30.label2=- Craft all button with a preview of the crafts and leftovers.
zk.about.changelog30.label3=- Item modes also available in chests, ender chests, shulker boxes, barrels, copper chests, hoppers, droppers, and dispensers.
zk.about.changelog30.label4=- Destroy Items mode in Creative, to delete items with a click.
zk.about.changelog30.label5=- Quick Move and Drop can take the whole stack or only one item.
zk.about.changelog30.label6=- Shorter craft all tooltip texts.
zk.about.changelog30.label7=- Smaller arrow on the craft all button of the crafting table.
zk.about.changelog020.title=§aPAUSE AND LOADING SCREENS
zk.about.changelog20.label1=- Redesigned pause screen with your skin beside it, centered buttons, and a shortcut bar.
zk.about.changelog20.label2=- Confirmation before leaving the world, with a red quit button.
zk.about.changelog20.label3=- World name on the pause screen, with featured server icons.
zk.about.changelog20.label4=- Option to hide the pause screen interface.
zk.about.changelog20.label5=- New loading screen with percentage and an animated pickaxe.
zk.about.changelog20.label6=- Notice when dimension loading gets stuck on servers.
zk.about.changelog20.label7=- About button also available in the pause shortcut bar.
zk.about.changelog20.label8=- Loading bar always visible when changing dimensions.
zk.about.changelog20.label9=- Servers in the center of the start screen, replacing Quick Play.
zk.about.changelog20.label10=- Removed Quick Play, which opened the new player flow and changed your current skin.
zk.about.changelog010.title=§aSETTINGS AND START SCREEN
zk.about.changelog10.label1=- Ore UI style settings screens: general, controls, world, storage, and packs.
zk.about.changelog10.label2=- New start screen with Play, Quick Play, Marketplace, skin beside them, and version in the footer.
zk.about.changelog10.label3=- Side menu with profile, inbox, achievements, servers, Realms, feedback, and quit.
zk.about.changelog10.label4=- Button to hide and show the start screen interface.
zk.about.changelog10.label5=- Ore UI style dialogs, confirmations, and loading screens.
zk.about.changelog10.label6=- About screen with features, credits, terms of use, and changelog.
zk.about.changelog10.label7=- Custom click sound on buttons.
zk.about.changelog10.label8=- Confirm button turns red on delete actions.
zk.about.changelog10.label9=- Smaller Minecraft logo for a lighter start screen.
zk.about.changelog10.label10=- Removed the duplicate navigation button from settings sub screens.
zk.about.changelog10.label11=- Releases published only when the version changes, with manual test builds.
zk.about.changelog10.label12=- Smaller start screen events panel, aligned with the buttons.
zk.about.changelog10.label13=- Restored the Delete button in the pack information screen.
zk.about.changelog10.label14=- Party section texts aligned with the rest of the settings.
zk.about.changelog10.label15=- Side menu feedback button now opens the feedback website.
zk.about.changelog001.title=§aINITIAL STRUCTURE
zk.about.changelog1.label1=- Base pack structure with manifest, icon, and description.
zk.about.changelog1.label2=- Automatic .mcpack build and GitHub release publishing.

